WEBVTT

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:47.460
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.880
One, two, three

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.220
Undead tree

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.640
What truth

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.350
I'll come true

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:07.560
Wow...

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:11.440
I see that bright light

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:17.910
This is all I have

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:22.290
What did you say?
I know

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.790
Why do you say?

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:32.380
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:39.090
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:43.560
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:47.230
Survive of vision

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:50.610
Unfinished heaven

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:54.400
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.160
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:02.910
Survive of vision

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.220
Hey.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.260
Hey!

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:21.930
Let's rest.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:24.180
We've still got a while before sunset.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.980
But...

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:27.480
Don't worry.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.940
I won't ask for something luxurious like alcohol.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.230
One barley tea and two skewered dango.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.860
Actually, one more dango!

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:41.240
And also, where's the toilet?

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:44.160
It's this way. You can go out the back.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:48.160
She seems a little glum lately.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:52.500
But since she has the appetite to eat,
I guess she's fine.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:16.400
Hey, you're blocking the light if you stand there.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.820
Get lost.

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.160
You.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.910
You're looking at something quite interesting.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.210
It's just a map.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.420
These various markings

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:38.550
all seem to be dojos in Edo that have been subjugated
by the Itto-ryu.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.180
You're well-informed.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.850
Especially for a monk,
usually unfamiliar with the world.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.600
I know more yet.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.060
About the man the two of you seek.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:53.850
That man...

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.900
Depending on your answer, I will tell you
Kagehisa Anotsu's whereabouts.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.320
There's nothing I won't tell.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.780
You're Manji, aren't you?

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.490
And who the heck are you?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.330
Swordsman of the Itto-ryu.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:11.830
My name

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.330
is Eiku Shizuma.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.130
As you can see, I am unarmed at the moment.

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:22.470
I knew you weren't a monk
the moment you stepped in front of me.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:26.050
Your smell of blood was overpowering.

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:33.940
I've killed 128 men thus far.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.440
Yet

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.820
my intuition tells me
you've killed a magnitude more.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.750
Besides, are you even allowed to speak?

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:00.050
About where Anotsu may or may not be.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:03.300
I told you it depends on your answer.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:07.140
Let's hear it then, this question.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:09.180
I wish to collaborate with you.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.060
What do you mean?

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:12.560
I will erase Anotsu.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:14.020
What?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.230
Do not misunderstand.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.980
It's not that I bear some grudge against him.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:23.570
In fact, I have the utmost admiration
for his ambition.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.570
Ambition?

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:31.370
The Itto-ryu's true nature begins with
the skepticism towards various schools.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:35.500
By practicing real combat, they shed
its reputation of the style having no practical use.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.170
They became more than just a school

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.130
by picking out only the most outstanding techniques
and assimilating them.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.340
If they succeed, it will be a stark change
from the empty husks

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.510
that make up modern swordsmanship.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.850
And what if they don't succeed?

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:54.270
Unfortunately, Kagehisa Anotsu is but a mere mortal.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.940
While he is of uncommon skill,

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:02.150
you can't ignore his susceptibility to illness
or surprise attacks.

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:03.400
You...

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.110
So you know about my body?

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.700
A man named Taito Magatsu

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.660
spoke highly of you.

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:14.290
Of your swordplay and of your immortal body.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:21.420
On our own, you and I would each find
defeating Anotsu challenging.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.380
But if we work together--

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:26.470
I'll let you live for today. Leave.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:30.430
I don't believe I professed any ill-will to you two.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:33.640
Call it instinct, or maybe a smell.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:38.560
You're a person who enjoys killing to their very core,
just like me.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:40.520
You'll find us sometimes.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:44.820
The kind who only feel alive when we're seeing blood.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:49.240
What? It's not something to be shy about.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.410
At the same time,

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:53.530
it's best you don't try and stand above others.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:58.960
If someone like that acquires influence,
the one thing they always do first

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.170
is massacre.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.550
All the more reason

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:11.470
for us to band together and become invincible.
Well,

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.640
I must say,

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:17.140
despite being called the Killer of 100,

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:20.310
I see you've got some good sense in you.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:21.440
You surprised me.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.650
I'm flattered.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.320
Who said it was praise?

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:29.950
I thought we'd come to a better understanding.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.570
Sadly, it won't be so.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:40.120
Look out! The dango are safe.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.210
Wait, I mean...

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:46.500
I think normally you'd worry about me
before the dango.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.590
What was this guy's deal?

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:57.100
He knew about my immortality
and only brought the one dagger?

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:58.770
Something's wrong with him.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:03.400
Sorry for the commotion.
We'll take care of the cleanup.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.230
Mr. Manji!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.320
I'll say it once more.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:14.990
We should have been...

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:16.620
able to...

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.120
reach a better understanding.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.620
You...

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.170
So you met the hag too.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:30.130
It was an old priestess with ink on her forehead
and both cheeks.

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.840
That old woman joined the Itto-ryu?

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:36.300
That's not the case.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:39.680
I acquired the sacred bloodworms

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:43.020
long before I became involved with the Itto-ryu.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.940
About 200 years ago.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.150
Two hundred...

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.400
That was when Ashikaga was still Shogun.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.400
Correct.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.860
I have watched an era pass with my own eyes.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:58.240
I have taken five wives until now,

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.530
had many children,

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.870
and many friends.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.160
But they've all gone before me.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.290
Death is unforgiving.

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:10.210
Yet being unable to die is even more cruel.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.050
However,

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.050
it's not like there are no options.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.850
Manji,

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:23.020
I'll put your response on hold for now.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.480
Remember this:

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:27.190
Nothing in this world is immortal.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:29.230
Not even the two of us

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.650
are exceptions.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.150
What do you mean by that?

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:36.320
I'm sure tonight you will come to know.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.210
-That's strange.
-What?

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.470
Mr. Manji...

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:07.940
Get out of here, Rin!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.110
No... Why is this...?

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.440
Get out of here!

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:19.200
No! Don't die! Hey!

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:22.410
You're Manji the immortal, aren't you?

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:25.450
Am I wrong? Am I wrong?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.300
What's going on?

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:35.380
These wounds...

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:39.430
He got me.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:41.510
That Eiku Shizuma...

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.220
It can't be... Poison?

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:46.810
Probably on that dagger.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.690
And this isn't just your average poison.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.160
Seems this is as far as I go.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.870
Rin, if I die,

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.290
you must not make a move on your own.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.750
-Hurry and find your next--
-Stop it!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.960
I don't want to hear it!

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.510
If you've been poisoned,

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.090
we just have to neutralize it.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.510
The Asano family's secret antitoxin.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.300
Mr. Manji, swallow these!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.390
Those things won't work.
We don't even know what kind of--

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:29.100
Swallow them all. Swallow them!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.110
I'll go find a doctor.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.070
We have to close those wounds.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.950
Idiot. What could a doctor even do?

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.990
I'll bring one right away.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.070
Stop! Don't wander off on your own.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.740
Hey! Don't go out there! Rin!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.130
PATIENTS WILL NOT BE SEEN AT THIS TIME

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.500
There's no way a doctor can help...

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.000
That's right,

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:01.300
Mr. Manji doesn't have a normal body anyway.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.840
They wouldn't even know what
sacred bloodworms--

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.640
Girl.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.010
What are you crying about?

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.890
On a night like this.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.230
A halo...

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:15.690
Pardon?

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.860
How nostalgic. Eiku Shizuma.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:25.410
If this was his doing, we're in big trouble.

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.830
You must hurry!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:27.870
Okay!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.760
It seems I'm still in one piece.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:54.940
Seriously, those booger-looking pills worked?

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:01.900
You're late.

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:04.070
I don't need a doctor.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:24.340
That absolute buffoon! Why couldn't she just listen?

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.260
EIKU SHIZUMA

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.600
I've placed them as you requested...

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.150
Why?

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.650
Who in the world are you?

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:47.610
Please, give him back.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:49.410
Very well.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.450
As promised, I will return him.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.040
My boy!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:59.290
It's okay now, Granny is here.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.920
Young lady, I'm so sorry.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.380
He threatened to kill my grandson!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.130
I'm sorry

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.220
for deceiving you.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.140
It's okay, you don't need to apologize.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:13.970
It's not your fault.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.440
Get out of here now! You need to get that baby
away from here!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.650
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:27.820
Hey.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.700
At least tell me this.

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:32.080
Is there no saving him from that poison?

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.000
Worm poison.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.870
It's a poison I happened to come by long ago

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.830
while wandering in Tibet.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.050
The sacred bloodworms that infest
mine and Manji's bodies

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.970
have the ability to restore body tissue.

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.970
Which means an "immortal" body

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:54.430
is sustained due to its relationship
with these abhorrent bugs.

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:57.600
But if this worm poison enters the bloodstream,

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.600
the pests will die.

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.440
And there is no antidote

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.150
for worm poison.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:08.530
Wait!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:10.660
What are you going to do? Stop!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.620
Please, don't!

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.580
Stop!

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.350
How could you kill them?

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:35.220
You're no samurai!

00:15:35.310 --> 00:15:38.600
Darn it! Just die, you scum!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:43.520
What is there to cry about?

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:45.650
They were total strangers.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.900
That's not the point!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:52.780
Why did an elderly woman and a baby need to die?

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.320
Mother!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.330
Why, you ask?

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.330
Would you like to know?

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.250
If you want to know, then I'll tell you.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.340
Two hundred years ago,

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.840
in the time of the Warring States,

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.720
I served under a military commander.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:15.720
Having lost my friends and family to war,

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:19.140
I even became immortal to continue fighting.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.690
The number I've killed on the battlefield is no less
than a thousand.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:23.900
But

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.480
after doing all that,

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:29.400
my lord readily surrendered to the Toyotomi family,

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.440
and the castle fell.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.360
Nothing remained.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:36.950
Soon, the Toyotomi family fell as well.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.950
The defeated are but worms.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:43.250
Me, you, and my wife

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.040
were born as worms and will die like worms.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.000
But I must at least leave something behind.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.970
Even a worm like me

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:53.760
needs to leave his mark.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:56.800
Drink it.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.890
If two fresh wounds meet...

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:04.390
there's a slight chance of
a sacred bloodworm infection.

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:09.480
Life is certainly precious,
and this would make you qualified for it.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:12.320
Live eternally, see endless death.

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.740
If you do, you will soon

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:17.160
see how utterly meaningless the death of a person is.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:20.580
Besides, with an immortal body,

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:23.750
fulfilling your revenge will surely be simpler.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:41.060
What's wrong? There's nothing to fear.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:45.850
Yes, that's right.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:58.160
Come on, how could you make a little girl cry
out in a shed like this?

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.990
If I could transfer the worms

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:07.920
to someone else so easily, I would have lived my life
without losing anyone dear to me.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.580
I've realized.

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:11.920
What I've needed from the start

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.260
was just someone who was the same as me.

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:17.970
Idiot. I'll take a pass on being your wife.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.220
Mr. Manji!

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.510
Quit crying!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:25.520
But an old lady and a baby...

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.230
Oh, them?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.650
The woman didn't make it, but the baby is unharmed.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:34.110
-If you're that worried, get over there and pick him up.
-Yes!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:40.280
A perfect moon for giving last rites.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.580
Let's begin, Eiku Shizuma.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:46.830
Yes, until one of us is dead.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:50.420
That's what I'm looking forward to.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:51.670
I'll bet.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.260
Thank goodness.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.330
That's not swordsmanship.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:27.950
It's not even a death match.

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.290
You'll find

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.420
I won't die so easily.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:40.430
This pain that we have to endure countless times

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.760
is the only pain

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:45.510
you and I will ever have in common!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:48.220
Dawn will soon break.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.650
From here on,

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.520
you will be staking your life.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:58.570
Staking my life, huh?

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:01.570
What a human-like position to be in.

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:03.110
I like it.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.710
It seems the worm poison hasn't fully left your body.

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:20.090
Unfortunately,

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:21.670
this is as far as you go.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:22.760
Eiku Shizuma!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:26.800
Please, die already.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.640
You've lived 200 years,

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.480
and nothing remained.

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.560
If you really couldn't leave one thing,

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.560
then you'll be

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:37.270
a worm to the very end.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.570
Perform,

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:39.820
Golden Bugs!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.660
What's this?

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:49.330
Don't tell me you've lost your nerve this late in the game.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.000
What I expected of you was--

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.170
Your turn to split apart, old man!

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:06.890
Mr. Manji!

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:09.560
You pushed it too far! Hey, are you okay?

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:12.480
Stop yelling. My ears are ringing.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.730
But I was so worried!

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.860
Girl.

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.860
While I still draw breath,

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:23.190
I will tell you.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.820
Half a month from now, Kagehisa Anotsu

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.320
will leave for Kaga.

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:29.410
What?

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:31.370
This is all

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:32.870
I can tell you.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.750
Shizuma, let me ask you this, too.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:39.540
You should have been able to avoid my attack
just now.

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.800
Why didn't you?

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.300
It's just like

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:44.880
the girl said.

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:48.260
After living my whole life as a worm,

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:49.970
I'm tired

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:52.270
of living life

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:53.600
like a worm.

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.440
Mr. Manji...

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:03.940
Between dying without reaching your goals,

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:06.360
or living forever

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:09.120
and learning you can't reach your goals,

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:10.780
which is more tragic?

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:15.580
You won't know until you die.

00:23:50.680 --> 00:23:53.680
ACT FIVE - SONG OF THE BUGS
